# Loaded ONLY by `vite build --mode e2e`, which is how playwright.config.js builds the app
# it serves. Committed deliberately, and it holds nothing secret: three empty assignments
# and a store id the rules deny.
#
# WHY IT EXISTS
#   Vite loads `.env` from the repo root on every build. A developer with a real `.env` —
#   which is the documented setup — therefore builds the e2e app with the PILOT'S OWN
#   Firebase project and `VITE_STORE_ID=yomyom-kafr-qasim`. Playwright gives each test a
#   fresh browser context, so each one mints a device id (ADR-021) and `pushAll` writes it
#   to the owner's live Firestore, and daily-surface.spec.js's AC-105 test clicks Done on a
#   real recommendation and records a real `acted` outcome against its real entry id.
#
#   Measured on 2026-09-21: `vintages.owner_state.devices.count` was **29**, of which 25
#   arrived between 14:58 and 15:04 on 2026-09-17 — several inside the same second. That is
#   one test suite, not twenty-nine devices, and it is the number Task 4.3's precondition
#   is supposed to rest on.
#
# WHY EMPTY AND NOT A FAKE VALUE
#   `isFirebaseConfigured()` gates on the three keys being non-empty, so empty is what makes
#   the app honestly unconfigured: no init, no anonymous sign-in, no network. A placeholder
#   would pass that gate and fail later, noisily, against a real endpoint.
#
#   An empty value in a shell variable does NOT do this — Vite treats an empty environment
#   variable as unset and `.env` wins. Verified. A mode file does override it, which is why
#   this is a file rather than a prefix on the command.
#
# THE SECOND LAYER
#   `VITE_STORE_ID` is a sandbox anyway, so even if the keys above were ever repopulated,
#   writes land at `stores/e2e-sandbox/...` and `firestore.rules` denies everything outside
#   `stores/yomyom-kafr-qasim/**`. Same mechanism that protects Vercel previews.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_STORE_ID=e2e-sandbox
